## Syntax highlighting for Visual Studio XML solution files (.slnx)

syntax "SolutionXml" "\.slnx$"

## Base: all text white
color white "^.+$"

## Full tag ranges (multiline)
color green start="<" end=">"

## Tag names (overrides green on the name portion)
color cyan "</?[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9._:-]*"
color cyan "/?>"

## Known slnx element names (overrides cyan)
color brightgreen "\<(Solution|Project|Folder|Properties)\>"

## Attribute values in double quotes
color yellow ""(\\.|[^"])*""

## Known slnx attributes
color brightcyan "[[:space:]](Path|Name|Id|Type|Configuration|Platform)="

## XML processing instruction
color brightblue start="<\?" end="\?>"

## XML comments (last — overrides everything else)
color yellow start="<!--" end="-->"

## Trailing whitespace
color ,green "[[:space:]]+$"
